{"unit_id":"yinhong-zhou__jevdo#card-zh","repo":"yinhong-zhou/jevdo","commit":"360b662d9ba72a362cb3eb81ffa89b2709fa4d7c","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.ts:27","src/dsh/runtime.ts:135","src/dsh/runtime.ts:145","src/dsh/runtime.ts:166","src/dsh/policy.ts:44","src/store.ts:92"],"text":"**JevDo**（DSH 插件）：在 DeepSeek Harness 中由 Jev 选择是否调用已保存的项目 Action，或把新问题交给主模型。工具支持查看 Action 目录、创建草稿、验证 recipe 和执行已验证操作；recipe 绑定项目并通过 verifier 检查。过期绑定会被拒绝，执行结果返回会话。适合复用开发命令与工作流的 DSH 用户。需要 Typesafe API Key 和宿主主模型配置；Action 与验证记录保存在本地。"}
{"unit_id":"yinhong-zhou__jevdo#card-en","repo":"yinhong-zhou/jevdo","commit":"360b662d9ba72a362cb3eb81ffa89b2709fa4d7c","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.ts:27","src/dsh/runtime.ts:135","src/dsh/runtime.ts:145","src/dsh/runtime.ts:166","src/dsh/policy.ts:44","src/store.ts:92"],"text":"JevDo adds Jev scheduling to DSH: it selects saved project Actions or hands new work to the main model. Tools create drafts, validate recipes, and run active Actions through host tools. Project-bound recipes are checked for staleness. Requires a Typesafe API key and main model."}
